    P -->|ret != 0 in PS7331| C[remove_waiter]
    C -->|uses current->pi_lock| X[current task identity]
    C -->|clears current->pi_blocked_on| X
    Y[No scoped current == task assertion observed] -.-> P
    Y -.-> C

